  "title": "Blueberry Scones",
  "description": "This blueberry scone recipe makes rich, moist, fruity scones bursting with fresh juicy blueberries. They're perfect for breakfast or afternoon tea!",
  "authors": [
    "Linda Letellier"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-09-09T18:19:26-04:00",
