  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup packed brown sugar",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 cup chilled unsalted butter, cut into pieces",
    "1 cup fresh blueberries",
    "0.75 cup half-and-half cream",
    "1 large egg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wx-8lsSHmWXbpiGLCIxuPibX37c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6946-Blueberry-scones-DDMFS-step-1-011-402bc2263c2c4931a70d4b9f10338325.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6946/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, brown sugar, baking powder, and salt in a bowl. Cut in cold butter with two knives or a pastry blender until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Add blueberries and toss to combine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WSmq8YX262Ex1UWeJ9cuJtWjZHM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6946-Blueberry-scones-DDMFS-step-2-0117-f6a371976cb34d49b4d8a7fd5f36b36d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6946/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk cream and egg together in a separate bowl until well combined; slowly pour into dry ingredients and stir with a rubber spatula until a dough starts to form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a8KJn1_0u87rBAur5tJo2RbFcGg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6946-Blueberry-scones-DDMFS-step-4-011-9526e5976ad24b729a4db25ec3d8add2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6946/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to a lightly floured surface and knead just until it comes together, 3 or 4 times; don't overwork the dough. Divide dough in half, then form each half into a 6-inch round.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r2q_-DEH1lqs-U9e2Iubhpb70RE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6946-Blueberry-scones-DDMFS-step-6-012-db0fd195e4d74c2c81c5a889ae653155.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6946/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to an ungreased baking sheet and cut each round into 6 wedges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mi8dRD1b3ERMLio7-vjemFIBBxE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6946-Blueberry-scones-DDMFS-step-8-018-32dd31e65e004f8aad7ca0e8112e4358.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6946/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until light golden brown, about 20 minutes. Serve warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4r673fWnd4GvGu34wvU3YH_2uyo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6946-Blueberry-scones-DDMFS-step-9-039-ef8f9bf65d094e41bbf07d62709ff843.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6946/step_06.webp"
    }
